title: The Civil Guards' Depots
subtitle: Every town has a depot full of rifles.
view-if: crisis_kapp = 1 and e20_kapp_arms_done = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; e20_kapp_arms_done = 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Civil Guards' Depots

Every town has its depot: the civil guards' rifles, the police armouries, the army's stores. In the Ruhr and in Thuringia the workers have already helped themselves. Elsewhere they are waiting for a word.

- @seize: Seize the depots.
- @battalions: Form workers' battalions under party discipline.
- @hide: Hide what we have for later.

@seize
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Ruhr Red Army will be bigger. In some towns the guards will fire first.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids an armed rising.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.kapp_armed = 1;
Q.civil_guards_strength -= 20;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.district('ruhr', {guards: 2, repression: 4});
RG.district('thuringia', {guards: 1, repression: 4});
!}

@battalions
subtitle: Fewer rifles. The men will take orders from the party, and the Ruhr will hold better for it.
on-arrival: e20_ruhr_extra += 5; red_guards_loyalty += 10; lean_luxemburgist += 1

Our battalions elect their officers and take their orders from the district leadership, not from whoever shouts loudest.

@hide
subtitle: Nothing now, something for the next time.
on-arrival: red_guards_arms += 8; lean_unionist += 1

Rifles go under the floorboards of union halls.
